+      <name slugifiedName="name-acknowledgements">Acknowledgements</name>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.f-1">This memo is based on the functionality of the original RTSP document
+submitted in October 96. It also borrows format and descriptions from
+HTTP/1.1.</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.f-2">This document has benefited greatly from the comments of all those
